{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30116","headline":"京兆府试目极千里 · 刘得仁","name":"京兆府试目极千里","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"献赋多年客，低眉恨不前。\n此心常郁矣，纵目忽超然。\n送骥登长路，有鸿入远天。\n古墟烟幂幂，穷野草绵绵。\n树与金城接，山疑桂水连。\n何当开霁日，无物翳平川。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘得仁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30116.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30116","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}